WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:01.730
Our surrogate is her mom in there to support

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.770
her. They asked me if I wanted to go in, but

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.950
I'm scared. I think it literally all leads

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:10.550
back to Provo Canyon School because they

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.100
were so vicious and sadistic.

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:18.200
Being abused in a doctor's setting has made

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.020
me have such post-traumatic stress disorder,

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.960
so if I'm in there, I would be on the floor

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.280
not being able to breathe.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.470
When you're giving birth, it's so scary as

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:29.360
it is. I don't want the surrogate being

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.650
stressed out at all.

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:33.320
I just want her to be happy and healthy so

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:34.970
that Phoenix gets here safely.

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:36.230
Let's wash our hands.

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:41.540
Okay. One second, one second.

00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:59.900
