00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:18.690
Oh, it's going to fall. Nope.

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.320
Didn't hurt at all. Oh.

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:29.710
I brought you warm blankets to put on top of

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:29.860
